#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Bounded next-cohort diagnostics of declared FP32 source/target visual triangles.

No model, checkpoint, simulator, evaluation, training, mesh Boolean or SDF engine.
Unsigned visual-triangle proximity is NOT exterior-union distance or physical
contact. Facet-normal statistics are explicitly conditional; outward union
normals and signed hand occupancy remain unresolved. No scientific PASS gate.
"""
